      "text": "Zoom from the keyboard"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "With the pointer over the preview, Ctrl and + zooms in, Ctrl and − zooms out and Ctrl and 0 goes back to fit width (Cmd on a Mac). Hold Ctrl and scroll, or pinch on a trackpad, for any size in between. The browser's own zoom stays as it is.",
